<p>kis umr me ali un naqi be pidar huwe<br />
bachpan me dil pe chot lagi nouhagar huwe<br />
yasrab me jaanasheen-e shahe behrobar huwe<br />
ye waaris-e bizaa-ate qairul bashar huwe</p>

<p>ilm-o amal ko maan liya sheq-o shaab ne<br />
kya kamsini me paayi buzurgi janaab ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>charqe neham imaam-e deham ka maqaam hai<br />
pushto panaah arsh-e baree'n inka naam hai<br />
har chaar simt mad'ha o sanaa-e imaam hai<br />
tasbeeh sash jahat ki durood-o salaam hai</p>

<p>naari hai jo kahe ke ye noore quda nahi<br />
anwaar qamsaa-e najbaa se judaa nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye door-e charq-e raah ye kaisa hai intezaam<br />
qaamosh kyu'n rahoo'n ke shikaayat ka hai maqaam<br />
rehne na paaye chain se is tarha se imaam<br />
qayam maqaam iske huve dushmane imaam</p>

<p>farzand par rasool ke ummat jafaa kare<br />
pursaa na jab koi ho to mazloom kya kare<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tayyar qatl par mutawakkil raha madaam<br />
majboor rehgaya wo adu-e shah-e anaam<br />
pahoncha safar me chod ke ye kaarina tamaam<br />
qaayam maqaam uske huwe dushman-e imaam</p>

<p>fursat mili na dilbare sher-e ilaah ko<br />
tadbeer motemad se mila zehr shaah ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo qalq ka maseeh huwa saheb e firaash<br />
be hiss tha jism farsh pe goya padi thi laash<br />
kunj-e lahad ki gosha nashee'n ko huwi talaash<br />
suraaq dil me tha toh kaleja tha paash paash</p>

<p>aate the haal dekhne baashinde shehar ke<br />
pota raza ka marta tha sadme se zaher ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>raavi bahut se haashmi is ke hai la kalaam<br />
jin me hai ek ka hasan ibn-e hussain naam<br />
aaya jo roz rehlat-e shaahe falak maqaam<br />
sehne makaa'n me farsh pe the jalwagar imaam</p>

<p>majma bahut tha syed-e zeejaah ke qareeb<br />
mardam the jamma ek sad-o panjaah ke qareeb<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nagaah askari nazar aaye hame udaas<br />
dakhil huve makaa'n me ayaa'n chehre se thi yaas<br />
paband hazn chaak gareebaan o be hawaas<br />
dahni taraf khade huve aakar pidar ke paas</p>

<p>kis haal me hai koun ye hai jaante na the<br />
huzzaar-e anjuman inhe pehchaante na the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>noor-e nazar ko dekh ke hazrat ne ye kaha<br />
kar shukr kirdegaar ka aye mere mehlaqaa<br />
haadas ek amr tere liye haq ne hai kiya<br />
rone laga ye sunte hi wo raaziye raza</p>

<p>bola ke shukr marhamat-e zuljalaal hai<br />
de apni nemate'n ye quda se sawaal hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>poocha kisi ne tab huwa maaloom sab ko haal<br />
ye hai hassan janaab-e ali un naqi ke laal<br />
zaaher huwa jo umr ki jaanib kiya qayaal<br />
hoga qareeb bees baras ka ye qush jamaal</p>

<p>samjhe ishaara ham ye kalaam-e imaam ka<br />
hai jaanashee'n yehi shah-e aali maqaam ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rota raha wasi-e shahinshaah-e behrobar<br />
saa-at wo aayi sar se uthaa saaya-e pidar<br />
ab saamere se hota jaha'n ki taraf safar<br />
hai hai chuta musaafir-e yasrab se ye bhi ghar</p>

<p>ghul padh gaya wafaate ghareebul watan huwi<br />
saamaan ghusl ka huwa fikr-e kafan huwi<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>